package CanvasNet {
    part def EdgeBuilder {
        doc /* The internal static EdgeBuilder (a partial class: route, stroke, and labels; the d3-shape curves; the markers) with the records EdgeEnd, EdgeRoute, EdgeDrawing, EdgeLabelDrawing, and MarkerPaint and the path context ICurveContext and CurvePath: a port of Mermaid's edges.js, edgeMarker.ts, the flowchart markers of markers.js, lineWithOffset.ts, and the edge helpers of utils.ts, with the line generator and edge curves of d3-shape. Draw (insertEdge) replaces the first and last points of the layout's route with the intersections of the end nodes' outlines, cuts the route at the subgraph it enters or leaves (cutPathAtIntersect and intersection with their quirks), drops points whose y is not a number, rounds off right-angle corners (fixCorners), pulls the ends back by the marker offsets, and draws the points with the edge's curve (basis by default; linear, natural, step, stepBefore, stepAfter, monotoneX, monotoneY, cardinal, catmullRom, bumpX, bumpY, and rounded) as path data rounded to three decimals as d3-path writes it; the path is stroked by the style sheet's rules for its classes (edge-thickness, edge-pattern, an animation class drawn as its first frame) and its inline styles, and the point, circle, and cross markers (with start variants) are placed as SVG places them with orient auto, in the style sheet's marker paint or the first stroke of the edge's styles. MeasureLabel measures an edge label as insertEdgeLabel creates it (200 pixel wrapping width, with a background); LabelPosition places it at the layout's position or the middle of the changed route, moved by half the subgraph title margin; DrawLabel centers it over the backgrounds of the style sheet. The class is stateless and safe for concurrent use. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source: src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid/Rendering/EdgeBuilder.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid/Rendering/EdgeBuilder.Curves.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid/Rendering/EdgeBuilder.Markers.cs */
        comment testRef /* Test: test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid.Tests/Rendering/EdgeBuilderTests.cs */
        comment designRef /* Design: docs/design/canvas-net-mermaid/rendering/edge-builder.md */
        comment verificationRef /* Verification: docs/verification/canvas-net-mermaid/rendering/edge-builder.md */
        comment reqRef /* Requirements: docs/reqstream/canvas-net-mermaid/rendering/edge-builder.yaml */
    }
}
